> ```
> """
> Normalized OpenAI model adapter.
> 
> The adapter owns provider-specific request translation, streaming, accounting,
> pricing, and availability checks. It does not select models or apply planner
> policy.
> 
> Legacy module-level functions remain as compatibility wrappers at the bottom.
> """
